  "prefLabel": "Env-Wt 315.06 Action After Emergency",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wt 315.06 Action After Emergency. Any permanent repairs, restoration, or other activities proposed to be conducted after the emergency has ended shall be undertaken pursuant to a statutory exemption, SPN, LSA, EXP, standard permit, or waiver.\n\nSource. #12803, eff 12-15-19",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wt300.html"
